  gameplayTrigger: Explicit heavy action through EnqueueCombatAction(side, Samurai_Execution10), exact server animationId Samurai_Execution10 or the existing animation browser. Explicit selection excludes random pools. Existing server outcome alone owns accepted damage; no local damage authority.
  entryAndInterruption: Native 1.7m spacing, receiver yaw 180, entry blend 0.12s, alignment error 0.15m; original clips and calibrated drivers; Katana attacker and owned unarmed receiver, receiver finger transfer enabled. No trajectory scaling, clamping or depth constraint. Existing cancellation restores both roles and owned equipment and cleans feedback. No added armor, stun or reaction restart.
